#ASSERT `Who decides whether I get the proposed treatment` `as the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `your person responsible`
#ASSERT `Who decides whether I get the proposed treatment` `as the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no-one under the section`
#ASSERT `Who decides whether I get the proposed treatment` `as the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the decider answer for` (`Who decides my treatment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- s 119: myself; my enduring guardian; no-one further.
#ASSERT `Who decides my other personal matters for me` `as the person` TRUE `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `you decide yourself`
#ASSERT `Who decides my other personal matters for me` `as the person` FALSE TRUE `an unasked fact` EQUALS `your enduring guardian`
#ASSERT `Who decides my other personal matters for me` `as the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no-one under the section`
#ASSERT `Who decides my other personal matters for me` `as the person` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the decider answer for` (`Who decides my other personal matters` FALSE FALSE TRUE)

§§ `For the attorney`

-- s 104C: 18 and of full legal capacity.
#ASSERT `May I be appointed as an attorney under an enduring power of attorney` `as the attorney` 18 TRUE EQUALS yes
